    Act 18 §7: generated board-trail index (curated mapping, not prose)
    
    Generate records/board-trail/index.json from the curated
    records/board-trail/originating.tsv mapping (the Act 18 §5 lens input) plus
    the board's terminal-update check — NOT from parsing bill/LAWS prose, which
    mis-maps issues that bills cite as examples (e.g. board-reporting-act.md
    cites #303/#307/#308).
    
    One entry per originating issue: issue, title (board), work, owning_office,
    stage, terminal_status, git_only_gap. git_only_gap is true when work is
    enacted/completed in Git but the originating issue lacks a terminal board
    update (the Act 18 §2 defect class). index.json is generated, so it is
    gitignored and untracked.
    
    Adds tests/board-trail-index-smoke.sh (mock board).

